  "details": "Problems with Mip Map Streaming\n\n1 256 textures from 1998 (HL1) are getting squashed to 32\n\n2 Every time Mips switch it stutters\n\n3 Unity doesn't unload Mips nicely so you can have multiple res loaded at once for extended periods eating up VRAM (Fixed in URP)\n\n4 Oculus menu has trouble rendering due to lack of VRAM (Pico too)\n\n5 there is no Prioritization of Mips it's blanket so it doesn't prioritize people next to me and myself so I look pasty\n\n6 I get Memory Low more often than before\n\nFix\n\nDisabled Mips Map Streaming until it can be Prioritized or Disabled",
